### 1. Envoyer un log ERROR (format JSON brut)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/logs/raw
Content-Type: text/plain

{"level":"ERROR","source":"api-gateway","message":"NullPointerException at com.example.Service.process(Service.java:42)"}

### 2. Envoyer un log INFO
POST http://localhost:8082/api/logs/raw
Content-Type: text/plain

{"level":"INFO","source":"web-app","message":"User logged in successfully"}

### 3. Voir tous les logs
GET http://localhost:8082/api/logs

### 4. Voir les logs par niveau
GET http://localhost:8082/api/logs/level/ERROR

### 5. Voir les incidents
GET http://localhost:8082/api/incidents

### 6. Voir les incidents OPEN
GET http://localhost:8082/api/incidents?status=OPEN

### 7. Stats des incidents
GET http://localhost:8082/api/incidents/stats

### 8. ChatOps - aide
POST http://localhost:8082/api/chatops
Content-Type: text/plain

help

### 9. ChatOps - lister incidents ouverts
POST http://localhost:8082/api/chatops
Content-Type: text/plain

list

### 10. ChatOps - stats
POST http://localhost:8082/api/chatops
Content-Type: text/plain

stats

### 11. Envoyer plein de logs ERROR pour declencher une anomalie
POST http://localhost:8082/api/logs/raw
Content-Type: text/plain

{"level":"ERROR","source":"api-gateway","message":"Connection timeout to database"}

### 12. ChatOps - acquitter un incident (remplace ID_ICI par un vrai ID)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/chatops
Content-Type: text/plain

ack ID_ICI

### 13. ChatOps - resoudre un incident (remplace ID_ICI par un vrai ID)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/chatops
Content-Type: text/plain

resolve ID_ICI

### 14. Acquitter un incident (remplace ID_ICI par un vrai ID)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/incidents/IZYBVKABGkeMiiUJCb4j/ack

### 15. Resoudre un incident (remplace ID_ICI par un vrai ID)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/incidents/IZYBVKABGkeMiiUJCb4j/resolve

### 16. Filtrer par severite
GET http://localhost:8082/api/incidents?severity=HIGH

### 17. Recherche temporelle (logs des 24 dernieres heures)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/logs/search?from=2026-08-29T00:00:00Z&to=2026-08-31T00:00:00Z

### 18. Recherche temporelle + filtre niveau
GET http://localhost:8082/api/logs/search?from=2026-08-29T00:00:00Z&to=2026-08-31T00:00:00Z&level=ERROR

### 19. Pagination des logs (page 0, 10 par page)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/logs?page=0&size=10

### 20. Tester KeywordAnomalyDetector — OOM
POST http://localhost:8082/api/logs/raw
Content-Type: text/plain

{"level":"ERROR","source":"jvm-monitor","message":"java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space at com.example.Service.process(Service.java:42)"}

### 21. Tester KeywordAnomalyDetector — deadlock
POST http://localhost:8082/api/logs/raw
Content-Type: text/plain

{"level":"ERROR","source":"db-pool","message":"Found one Java-level deadlock in thread pool-3-thread-7"}

### 22. Log Apache
POST http://localhost:8082/api/logs/raw
Content-Type: text/plain

192.168.1.1 - - [23/Aug/2026:14:30:00 +0000] "GET /api/users HTTP/1.1" 500 1234

### 15. Log Syslog
POST http://localhost:8082/api/logs/raw
Content-Type: text/plain

<11>Aug 23 14:30:00 server01 myapp: Critical failure in module X
